{
  "name": "bora-of-mfa",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Bora of Mfa: MFA coverage from an identity provider export: active users with no MFA registered, users with only SMS or voice, administrators without phishing-resistant MFA, people excluded from MFA policy, registered but never used, and shared accounts that can sign in. Names masked for the model. Drafts notes; never changes a policy.",
